1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,028
My strong mother…

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,557
My strong mother, always up before dawn.

3
00:00:10,557 --> 00:00:14,660
Everything she did for us will never
leave my heart.

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:20,812
The love she gave me, her advice, the
hope she gave me, her calm…

5
00:00:20,812 --> 00:00:24,892
all of it lives in my heart as a
precious memory.

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:29,991
To raise me and send me to school, there
was no slope she did not go down,

7
00:00:29,991 --> 00:00:31,604
no hill she did not climb.

8
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:38,149
She never divided work into men's work
and women's work.

9
00:00:38,149 --> 00:00:39,956
She did it all, tirelessly.

10
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:45,492
She spent many years herding sheep.

11
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:53,652
So that I could study from grade 1 to
grade 12, and go on to university,

12
00:00:56,400 --> 00:01:02,316
and even after I graduated, until I found
work, she helped me in so many ways.

13
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:08,583
So often the weight of the family rested
on her.

14
00:01:08,583 --> 00:01:12,828
Her love for her children, the tiredness
she carried in silence…

15
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:18,782
My mother does not say much in words,
but she showed me with her life.

16
00:01:18,782 --> 00:01:24,164
My strong mother… your love and your
memory will never leave my heart.
